==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|gliten|glīten|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|glitan|glītan|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{recons|glīdaną|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|nl}} {{recons|glīdaną|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|nl}} {{recons|ǵʰleydʰ-|lang=ine-pro}}. Compare Low German {{term|glieden|lang=nds}}, Dutch {{term|glijden|lang=nl}}, English {{term|glide|lang=en}}.

===Verb===
{{de-verb-strong|class=1|gleitet|glitt|geglitten|auxiliary=sein}}

